window.products.push({"id":585279,"name":"Levtex Home - Margaux Quilt Set - Kids Twin/Twin XL Quilt and One Standard Sham - Medallion - Grey, White and Blush - Quilt (66x86in.) and Sham (20x26","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GGSKF4YIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton THE MARGAUX DESIGN: One of our most popular quilt sets, Margaux is inspired by French design. The front features an intricate floral medallion design in grey with blush pink borders and accents and reverses to the same pattern. A bound border provides contrast and texture to complete the look. SOFT AND COMFORTABLE LUXURY: Made from the softest cotton and filled with a polyester filler, this quilt will never feel heavy, stiff or uncomfortable. The Margaux quilt has an ultra soft feel that you will simply love. Our quilt (66x86in.) and the matching sham are designed to give your kid's bedroom a feeling of comfort and luxury. EASY CARE: Pre washed for your convenience, the Margaux quilt is easy to look after. Simply machine wash on a cold, gentle cycle, then line dry or tumble dry at low temperature. COORDINATE YOUR ROOM DECOR: Create a wonderful bedroom space with our coordinated reversible quilt. The white, blush, and grey design brings classic elegant accents into your little girl's bedroom and will match a variety of different looks and bedroom decor. You can also freshen the room with other items from the Margaux collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GGSKF4YIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Levtex Home","source_asin":"B00T6OTFIY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-585279","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00T6OTFIY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00T6OTFIY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
