window.products.push({"id":585281,"name":"63\" Long Sheer Curtain Panel -Neon Blue (Aqua / Teal)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418p6DepFyL._AC_.jpg","description":"This package contains one (1) piece 63 inch long sheer curtain. The picture shows 2 curtains and 1 window scarf. The curtain is approximately 56” wide. For standard size windows (23 to 36 inches wide), it is recommended that you use 2 packages. This curtain has a rod pocket for easy hanging. These curtains will accent any room in your house. They allow natural light to filter into your room. 100% polyester. Can be machine washed in cold water (gentle cycle) and line dry. Iron on lowest setting if needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418p6DepFyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moshells","source_asin":"B00AO7WC4G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-585281","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AO7WC4G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AO7WC4G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
