window.products.push({"id":585346,"name":"Willow Tree Song of Joy Angel, Sculpted Hand-Painted Figure","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cjUQLG2iL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"TITLE: Song of Joy SENTIMENT: Singing… Soaring! All in universal harmony GIFT-GIVING SUGGESTIONS: Song of Joy and Dance of Life angels are designed for the Willow Tree Nativity display. Or they can be enjoyed as table or mantel holiday decor. Singly or together, they are wonderful wedding gifts, new baby gifts, spiritual milestone commemoratives, and holiday pieces. Willow Tree angels resonate with many cultures and ages of people. To some they represent protection, to some they are an outward reminder of inner peace, and to some they represent a way to remember those who have left this earth. Hand-carved figures reveal their expression through body gestures only... a tilt of the head, placement of the hands, a turn of the body. Since 1999, American artist Susan Lordi has worked in partnership with DEMDACO to produce, market and distribute Willow Tree , her line of carved figurative sculpture. From her studio in Kansas City, Lordi hand carves the original of each figure. This piece is cast from Lordi's original and painted by hand. Enclosed inside each fitted packaging box is a gift-giving card with piece title and sentiment on it. Each piece is intended to be open to interpretation from the viewer. \"Willow Tree isn't so much about the tangible piece. It represents an emotion or it marks a memory.\" -Susan Lordi Ready to display on a shelf, table or mantel. To clean, dust with soft brush or cloth. Avoid water or cleaning solvents.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cjUQLG2iL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Willow Tree","source_asin":"B0071XOKGE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-585346","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0071XOKGE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0071XOKGE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":585347,"name":"MDEALY 30-Piece Rainbow Silverware Set for 6, 18/0 Stainless Steel Flatware Cutlery Utensils Set, Include Dinner Knives,Dinner Forks,Dinner Spoons,Sal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mW-dC9h2L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"MDEALY 30-Piece Rainbow Nice Weight Silverware Utensils Set, Good Quality Stainless Steel Flatware Cutlery Set for 6, Include Dinner Knife set of 6,Dinner Fork set of 6,Dinner Spoon set of 6,Salad Fork set of 6,Teaspoon set of 6, Elegant Gift Variation: 30 Piece Rainbow Silverware Set Color: rainbow silverware set service for 6 6 Piece Dinner Knive: 8.74 INS, Weight: 0.152 LB 6 Piece Dinner Spoons: 8.46 INS, Weight: 0.110 LB 6 Piece Dinner Forks: 8.46 INS, Weight: 0.094 LB 6 Piece Salad Forks: 6.3 INS, Weight: 0.043 LB 6 Piece Teaspoons: 6.3 INS, Weight: 0.052 LB Care and Used: This Rainbow silverware is made of nice weight 18/0 stainless steel, which is not easy to rust and dishwasher safe. But it doesn't mean that the silverware set will never rust. Almost all stainless steel silverware will rust, as to how long, or how easy it is to rust, depending on the environment the silverware is in. When the surface of the silverware set adheres to the juice of the organic food such as melons or vegetables after meals for a period of time, the silverware is easy to rust. In addition, soaking silverware in acid, alkali, or other dissolved oxygen solution for a long time, will quickly rust the silverware. So in order to prolong the service life of silverware, it should be cleaned and dried after meals, which can make our silverware better play its value. After Sales Service: Each Piece of MDEALY Silverware Set with NO RISK and 100% Money Back, If You have Any Question, Please Kindly E-mail Us for Better Service. Noted: Please Make Sure This Rainbow Silverware Set is out of The Reach of Your Baby.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mW-dC9h2L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MDEALY","source_asin":"B07YRXC4TJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-585347","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YRXC4TJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YRXC4TJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
