window.products.push({"id":585561,"name":"NE Kids Stair Loft with Chest End in Chocolate Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RyGvwAAyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Mattress ready with complete slat system - no foundation required. A twin bed on top with a choice of twin or full size lower bed. A Five Drawer Chest with two bookshelves. Four built in drawers in the staircase steps. The giant bottom drawer can roll out into the room and store almost anything. Loft can accommodate an eight inch mattress. Twin or full size lower bed is optional. Desk and stair end are interchangeable and can be assembled on either end of bed. Desk rotates to allow for studying under upper bed. 3 drawers on side mounted euro guides are integrated into the steps. The bottom drawer is huge allowing for incredible storage. Made from hardwood and veneer. Assembly required. 99.5 in. L x 42 in. W x 67 in. H. Bunk Bed Warning. Please read before purchase.. NOTE: Shopladder DOES NOT offer assembly on loft beds or bunk beds. Imagine how cool it would have been to climb a staircase complete with handrail to the second story of your very own room, now it's possible. The Stair Loft with Chest end has flexible sleeping options as well as a ton of storage for all things kid, Our flagship collection, Schoolhouse is the culmination of decades of research and experience with both consumers and retailers. We took the time to ask the right questions, and Schoolhouse is a direct result of the answers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RyGvwAAyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NE Kids","source_asin":"B010Z0TVHM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-585561","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B010Z0TVHM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B010Z0TVHM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
