window.products.push({"id":585594,"name":"100 Pieces Parchment Paper Baking Sheets 8 x12 Inches, Precut Non-Stick Parchment Paper for Baking, Cooking, Grilling, Frying and Steaming - Unbleache","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LFerU0gXL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"📜 【SAVE YOURSELF THE HASSLE】 – Are you tired of cutting conventional parchment paper that curl up as soon as it’s on the baking tray? Well, your struggles are finally over. JOMVERL precut, and unbleached baking sheets will not curl, stick or burn leaving you with just one thing to do – let your delicious recipes come to life! Perfect for baking bread, pastries, cookies, croissants, cakes, cupcakes, rolls and more. Our parchment sheets will take the hassle out of your baking, guaranteed! 📜【THE RIGHT SHEETS FOR BAKING YOUR FAVORITES】 - Our sheets are greaseproof, waterproof, and non-toxic; they will not tear, rip or soak through. They withstand temperatures up to 🌡️ 450 degrees Fahrenheit, which is higher than most recipes require. Both of the sheets’ sides are coated with non-toxic silicone coating making it a safe choice for your baking needs. Since the food just slides off, no additional oils need to be sprayed on the sheet prior to baking. 📜【HEALTHY ALTERNATIVE】 –100pcs pre-cut parchment paper sheets made of extra thicker 45gsm paper, it's about 12% thicker than others'. Made from natural 100% wood pulp, our parchment sheets are a much healthier alternative to Quilon sheets. Quilon contains a chemical called Chromium that can be harmful once ingested. Our parchment squares are compostable and recyclable, making them less harmful for the environment. JOMVERL sheets are also not chemically bleached like other brands. 📜 【NON-STICK & CONVENIENT PACKAGING】 – Never want to experience folding parchment paper ever again? Our sheets come in a bag that is easy to store without folding or tearing. The bag will keep the sheets’ perfect shape and freshness until next time. Parchment squares also work great as a food wrap for any to-go food. Need to wrap up your lunch? JOMVERL sheets are an excellent way of keeping your carry out fresh. And if your food has gotten cold, the sheets are microwave safe. 📜 【YOUR 100 % SATISFACTION, GUARANTEED】 – At JOMVERL we take customer satisfaction very seriously. If for ANY reason our baking squares don’t live up to your expectations, let us know and we will make sure that the things are made right. Our products are crafted by trusted artisans from carefully selected materials that have been sourced only from approved suppliers. Quality is our priority. Get your parchment baking sheets today and enjoy hassle free baking for the years to come!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LFerU0gXL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOMVERL","source_asin":"B08MT1BYHT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-585594","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MT1BYHT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MT1BYHT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
