window.products.push({"id":585703,"name":"Zerust No-Rust Non-Slip Drawer Liner - 18 in x 96 in - Made in The USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ziJSpB6yL._AC_.jpg","description":"Rust and Corrosion Protection for:Steel, Iron, Brass, CopperAluminum, Silver and NickelUse Zerust No-Rust Non-Slip Drawer Liners to protect household items such as garden tools, toolbox contents, firearms, coin collections, jewelry, and more.HOW norust by ZERUST WORKSThese drawer liners contain proprietary ZERUST VCI (Vapor Corrosion Inhibitor) formulations That are designed to protect metal surfaces from surface rust/corrosion while within en enclosure. When a liner is removed from its sealed polyethylene bag and placed in an enclosure, it begins to emit an invisible, odorless, non-toxic vapor, which diffuses throughout Iv surrounding atmosphere until the air is saturated. The ZERUST rigger molecules will cling to metal surfaces and protect them from rust and corrosion until the metal object being protected is removed from the enclosure. After removal from the ZERUST environment, the protective molecules dissipate.EASY INSTALLATION AND USEZERUST drawer liners are easily and simply installed in a matter of seconds. Simply cut liner to required drawer dimensions. It is important, however, to follow these guidelines: think enclosure. Be sure to minimize the exposure of the enclosed area to the outside atmosphere. This can shorten the life span of the chemical effectiveness of the VCI.norust by ZERUST SAFETYDrawer liners can be used in any environment without measurable chemical interaction. norust by ZERUST vapors will not harm wood or wood surfaces.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ziJSpB6yL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zerust","source_asin":"B06XB1BH2S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-585703","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XB1BH2S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XB1BH2S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
