window.products.push({"id":585750,"name":"Elite Gourmet ERC2010B Electric Rice Cooker with Stainless Steel Inner Pot Makes Soups, Stews, Porridge's, Grains and Cereals, 10 cups cooked (5 Cups ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+5ikLaS1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Here’s how you can cook fluffy & delicious rice like a professional chef effortlessly! do you like rice but cooking it seems like a boring and time-consuming process? do you want to make sure that your basmati rice is evenly cooked and always ready to serve? now you don't have to waste your time standing over a boiling pot anymore thanks to the most innovative and time-saving rice cooker! representing the Elite Gourmet ERC-2010B ultimate Professional rice cooker! you don't have to be a master chef in order to impress your loved ones with the fluffiest, most delicious and perfectly cooked rice anymore! this time-saving and easy-to-use rice cooker is going to become your little secret! why choose the Elite Gourmet rice cooker? save time by cooking up to 10 Cups of rice – cooking large quantities of rice can be tricky but you don't have to worry anymore! our practical rice cooker can cook up to 10 Cups (5 Cups uncooked) of rice, enough for the whole family! stainless steel inner pot will make your life easier – the removable surgical-grade 304 stainless steel pot will make sure that your rice is evenly cooked and cleaning it is as simple as 1, 2, 3! keep your rice warm & fresh for hours – the handy “keep warm” function will allow you to prepare your Jasmine or Brown rice in advance and serve it once the rest of the meal is ready! perfect for all types of rice – whether you like perfectly cooked Jasmine rice, Brown rice, Black rice, basmati rice or Sushi rice, the ERC-2010B rice cooker will get the job done! and not just for rice – you can use our premium rice cooker to steam vegetables, meat, beans or quinoa and cook delicious meals effortlessly! don’t hesitate! click “add to cart now & enjoy your favorite rice dishes like never before!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+5ikLaS1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elite Gourmet","source_asin":"B0BX71S3RC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-585750","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BX71S3RC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BX71S3RC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
