window.products.push({"id":585760,"name":"CiyvoLyeen Easter Bunny Gnomes Decor Spring Gifts Set of 3 Girl Room Decor Nordic Swedish Nisse Scandinavian Tomte Elf Dwarf Home Household Ornaments","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OgDN0g2rL._AC_SL1471_.jpg","description":"SYMBOL OF LUCK -- The Swedish Nisse(also known as the Tomte or Gnomes) is a mythological creature from Scandinavian folklore. According to tradition the Nisse lives in the houses and barns of the homestead and secretly acts as their guardian. If treated well they protect the family from evil and misfortune. 100% HANDMADE -- Each Spring Gnomes comes with a white beard and pink ears. It has a wire in the ears so you can shape them to fit the way you like. Stable and light weight base enables multiple use locations such as table, sofa, bookcase, shelves, mantels and bottle tops. Great additions to your home decor in spring season. Unique Design and Perfect Size -- The design of these Easter bunny gnomes compromises classic elements of Easter like bunny, brightly colored eggs, look perfect next to your favorite Easter decorations. The spring gnomes are 13.5 inches tall from the top of the hat to the base. Perfect Gift -- The adorable gnomes is a great gift and decor for any occasion like Easter, spring party, wedding, birthday, etc, Create a festive mood and bring good luck. Customer Service -- If you have any questions about our products, please feel free to contact us. We strive to provide you with the best quality product and the best service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OgDN0g2rL._AC_SL1471_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CiyvoLyeen","source_asin":"B083QCD45F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-585760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083QCD45F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083QCD45F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":585761,"name":"MODFUNS Purple Backdrop Curtain Chiffon 10FT Sheer Chiffon Curtains 2 Panels 29x120 Inch Tulle Backdrop for Wedding Drapery Arch Draping Fabric Ceilin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.72,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YW6A6bEsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥂【Size & Color - Purple Backdrop Curtain】You will get 2 panels purple chiffon fabric curtains. Each panel measures 29\" width x 10ft height. Voile sheer curtains add romantic atmosphere to your wedding and create a hazy feeling that make your wedding party decoration more perfect. 🥂【Premium Material - Purple Chiffon Curtains】Background curtains for party are made of high-quality chiffon fabric, silky soft and durable, wrinkle-resistant and reusable, natural draping, delicate edges and stitching. Tulle backdrop drapes are ideal backdrop for weddings and parties, which bring an elegant ambiance. 🥂【Delicate Design - Chiffon Sheer Curtains】Each sheer backdrop curtain has a 4\" rod pocket at the top, which can be easily hung on poles or background stands. The ceiling curtains for party with lights, artificial flowers and balloons will make the backdrop curtains more special. 🥂【Widely Application - Tulle Backdrop for Wedding】Our chiffon party curtains are perfect for weddings arch, stages, prom, receptions, indoor outdoor parties, candy buffets, dessert table backgrounds, home events, photography, birthdays, photo booths, ceremony, engagement, baby and bridal showers and more. Sheer backdrop drapes create a greatly eye catching decoration in your wedding, which add a highlight to your unforgettable moment. 🥂【Care Tips - Arch Draping Fabric】It is recommended to clean the chiffon curtains for wedding with cold water, do not bleach, hanging dry, do not twist. MODFUNS is a trusted brand with the professional team. If you have any questions, please kindly contact us. We will solve you issues until you’re satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YW6A6bEsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MODFUNS","source_asin":"B0BND7JFTX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-585761","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BND7JFTX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BND7JFTX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
