window.products.push({"id":585840,"name":"Laundry Hamper with Wheels; 174L Extra Large Rolling Laundry Cart with Removable Liner Bag; Heavy Duty Laundry Basket with Side Pocket; Commercial Lau","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":58.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zdO7jo4gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Built with 4 Caster Wheels & Lid】 The clothes hamper is built with 4 heavy duty wheels so that it is a breeze to transport heavy stuff. Besides, high quality wheels can easily move through hardwood floors or carpet and also not scratch them. More importantly, the 2 wheels of clothes hamper are designed with safety brakes. You can brake it if you need to stop. In addition, the clothes basket has an oxford fabric lid. The fabric lid can protect privacy when you roll the hamper into elevator hall. It not only prevents dust from getting into hamper, but also protects laundry from pets biting. 【Built with Removable Liner Bag & Side Pocket】 The clothes basket has a larger liner bag and side pocket, which make sorting laundry simple, saving time and effort. More importantly, the extra large liner bag is made from the oxford material that can be removed to wash. In addition, it is not only a clothes basket but also a toy basket. 【Extra Large Capacity:174L】 The dimensions of commercial clothes cart: (28.74''+5.9'')L x 15.75\"W x 30.9\"H. The MAX capacity is about 174L(46 Gallons). The commercial clothes cart is big enough to hold a good amount of dirty clothes. A nice addition to the bathroom/living room/bedroom/laundry room. Keeps dirty laundry out of sight. It is not only a clothes laundry hamper but also a toy basket. 【Sturdy Metal Frame-MAX Load: 100 lbs】 The frame of clothes sorter is made of thickened rust-proof iron, which increases the load bearing ability (MAX Load: 100 lbs). In addition, there are 2 wood boards to reinforce frame stability. More importantly, it is a breeze to assemble. 【Suitable for Many Occasions】 The rolling clothes hamper is with 2 separate compartments. Large compartments can hold heavy stuff. Side pocket can hold small parts (like underwear, socks or laundry detergents). It is not only a laundry basket but also a commercial cart to be used in warehouse, hotel, laundry room. 【Easy to Assemble】The clothes hamper is equipped with small wrench so that it is a breeze to put it together.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zdO7jo4gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Heeytilly","source_asin":"B0B41RB8J6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-585840","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B41RB8J6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B41RB8J6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
