window.products.push({"id":585882,"name":"Graduation Banner 2022 Class of 2022 Burlap Congrats Grad Garland Vintage Graduation Decorations Sign for College High School Grad Party Supplies","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.16,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CR9O3jjOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎓Great value for the money: You will get 3pcs of pre-strung burlap banners, \"2022\", \"CONGRATS\", \"GRAD\". 🎓Nice addition to your graduation decorations: The burlap graduation banner is made of 100% natural burlap, durable and reusable. So much better than paper banners. 🎓Black satin bows were added, which add a fancy yet retro feel to the graduation party. Perfect addition to the class of 2022 decorations! 🎓Ready to use: The graduation banner comes pre-strung, which means it's ready to hang it over the wall, window, porch, fireplace or veranda. The Congrats Grad banner will make your kid’s graduation party unforgettable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CR9O3jjOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ERTREE","source_asin":"B09NN4YPPG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-585882","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NN4YPPG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NN4YPPG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":585883,"name":"HotLogic Mini Personal Portable Oven with Glass Dish (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oMxclLA8L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"MAGIC MINI OVEN: Whether you’re at the office, job site, campsite, or about to travel in the car, the Hot Logic Mini Personal Portable Oven with glass included is perfect for hot, delicious food on the go. Whether you are cooking, reheating, or enjoying a prepackaged meal, this mini oven cooks your food to the perfect temperature. Available in black, blue, green, purple, orange, or pink. REVOLUTIONARY COOKING TECHNOLOGY: Better than an insulated lunchbox, the Mini can reheat or even cook your meals as a low-slow conduction heat to bring foods to the ideal temperature and hold them there without overcooking or drying the food! Unlike microwaves or traditional slow cookers, there are no buttons, dials, or timers. The Hot Logic Mini can be used to cook frozen meals or reheat leftovers. MEALTIME FREEDOM: How much time would you save if you could cook a meal without worrying about setting a timer, adjusting the temperature, or stirring your food while working? Unlike any other appliance, the Hot Logic Mini removes the time constraints from your meal. Whether you eat your food as soon as it is ready or you want to wait a few hours, your meal will be hot and cooked perfectly. MUST-HAVE KITCHEN ACCESSORIES: The Hot Logic Mini offers the convenience of no-prep hot meals. Compatible with most meal prep containers, including glass, plastic, or metal, our slow cookers make cooking fun and easy! Our Mini includes a glass container and is ideal for office workers, teachers, and anyone on the go. As an added bonus, the Hot Logic Mini was made in the US! HOT LOGIC CARES: We are confident that once you experience the power of the Hot Logic Mini Personal Portable Oven, the only regret you will have is that you didn’t learn about it sooner! However, we also stand behind our products, so if you are unsatisfied within the first 90 days of your purchase, please contact us so we can make it right; your satisfaction is important to us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oMxclLA8L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOTLOGIC","source_asin":"B00KDK2RS0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-585883","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KDK2RS0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KDK2RS0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
