window.products.push({"id":585981,"name":"Muffin and Cupcake Packaging, Holds 12 Standard Size Cupcakes or Muffins- Count of 24 units","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JLran8IGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"12 COMPARTMENT CONTAINERS:  Beautifully display your muffins, cupcakes, and other treats in our crystal clear 12-compartment cupcake carriers. Made of durable OPS plastic, our cupcake boxes are durable and sturdy making transportation a breeze. The compartments hold your baked goods in place, keeping your delicately decorated baked goods undamaged. Perfect for muffins, cupcakes, mini bundt cakes, cookies, and more!  DURABLE CARRIER FOR TRANSPORT: We’ve designed our cupcake holders disposable with hinged lock tabs to securely seal the trays. The cups are made with ribbing along the sides and around the base to snuggly fit cupcake liners. The two funnel-shaped supports prevent the lid from bowing. KEEP YOUR TREATS INTACT:  In addition to being water and oxygen resistant, our plastic cupcake containers disposable are also odor resistant so you won’t have to worry about any unsavory smells affecting the taste of your baked goods. The deep compartments prevent your baked goods from being toppled over while being transported, keeping your icing, sprinkles, and other decorations neatly in place. EASY PERSONALIZATION: Customize these disposable clear cupcake containers by adding your company logo and/or icon, stickers, labels, ribbons, etc. Perfect for bakeries, cafes, restaurants, catering businesses, birthday parties, weddings, and more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JLran8IGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oasis Supply","source_asin":"B01DTD6IAA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-585981","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DTD6IAA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DTD6IAA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
